id: mobile-wiki-pinch
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: Pinch in then out on en.m.wikipedia.org: the page follows and the card is never left grey (Mojo found grey once)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad
kit: cavekit-mojo-ui.md R6
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:#firstHeading' 40
calibrate 'sel:#firstHeading'
pinch 384 400 400 100
wait still 0,100,756,700 5
expect zoom-min 0.65
expect content 0,100,756,700 'sel:body'
expect text-has 'sel:#firstHeading' TouchPad
pinch 384 400 100 400
wait zoom 10
expect zoom-min 1.05
expect content 0,100,756,700 'sel:body'
